                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} CauchyNetsIn(\mathbb{Q}) \coloneqq \bigcup_{I \in Ob(DirectedSet_\mathcal{U})} C(I, \mathbb{Q})
          %p
            be the (large) set of all Cauchy nets in
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi ℚ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{Q}
            in a
