          %p
            The
            %em category of generalized Cauchy algebras
            is the category
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi GCAlg
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} GCAlg
