            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Ob
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi GCAlg
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Ob(GCAlg)
            are generalized Cauchy algebras and whose morphisms
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Mor
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi GCAlg
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Mor(GCAlg)
            are generalized Cauchy algebra homomorphisms. The set of
            = succeed "," do
